  "description": "✨ BANANA SODA – The Ultimate Cute & Chunky Bubble Font!\nAdd a splash of fun, sweetness, and retro vibe to your next design project! Banana Soda is a playful, bold display bubble font designed to make your words pop. With its shiny highlights and bouncy, organic shapes, it’s perfect for creating eye-catching titles, cheerful branding, and trendy merchandise.\nWhether you are crafting for a kids’ party, designing Y2K/retro-inspired streetwear, or making cute stickers, this font is your perfect creative companion.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>✨ BANANA SODA – The Ultimate Cute &amp; Chunky Bubble Font!</p>\n<p>Add a splash of fun, sweetness, and retro vibe to your next design project! Banana Soda is a playful, bold display bubble font designed to make your words pop. With its shiny highlights and bouncy, organic shapes, it’s perfect for creating eye-catching titles, cheerful branding, and trendy merchandise.</p>\n<p>Whether you are crafting for a kids’ party, designing Y2K/retro-inspired streetwear, or making cute stickers, this font is your perfect creative companion.</p>",
